description	"Babu Frik

A tiny mechanic who relies on his contraptions and teammates to get the job done. Frik's vast knowledge of machinery means he's both an expert at disassembly as well as a pro modder.

^2Weaponry:
- Light Melee
- Ion Rifle (Clone Rifle 1)
-- Ion Blob (8)
-- 50% faster Shot Swap
-- 50% less Dmg
-- Sec only
- DEMP2 (3)
-- Ion Shockwave (2)
-- 50% less Dmg
- Equalizer Ion Launcher (3)
-- 75% less Vel
-- 50% less Dmg
-- 15% less Spd
- F-187 Fusioncutter (Stun Baton 1)
-- Burns on hit
-- 80% faster RoF
-- 65% less Dmg

^6Inventory:
- Armored Gonk Droid (Support Beacon) ^3[CS3]
- Assault Sentry ^3[CS1]
- Defense Seeker
- Seeker Drone
- Forcefield ^3[CS4]
- Electrobinoculars

^8Attributes:
- Personal Energy Shield
- Assassin Droid (Bodyguard)
- Base Dmg Taken
- Melee Resist
- Armor Regen: 25/15s
- Healing (3)
- 10% faster Hacking
- 10% less Kb Given
- 80% more Kb Taken
- Ally Stat Viewer
- Slow Faller

^3Abilities:
- Armor/BP/Resource Dispenser (2) ^3[Use]
-- +1 Range
- Mirthful Exclamation (Toxic Taunt)
- Shield Discharge ^3[CS2]"